     "titulo": "Questions with «if»",
     "texto": [
      "For yes-or-no questions, use **se** (if): **Perguntou-me se ias à festa** (he asked me if you were going to the party).",
      "Watch out: the question mark is not used, nor the word order of the original question."
     ],
