     "titulo": "Questions with a question word",
     "texto": [
      "With **onde**, **quando**, **o que**, **quem** the question word is kept: **Perguntou-me onde estavas** (he asked me where you were).",
      "The verb changes to imperfect or past depending on the case."
     ],
